  "interfaceBaseline": "V32 preserves the existing interface and integrated Ledlines instellen. New SPI zones default to Doorlopend: one continuous preview line. Tunnel shows horizontal ledlines below one another; Wand shows vertical ledlines side by side. The main preview immediately follows proposed layout and order, without saving or sending light commands before Bewaren; Annuleren restores the saved arrangement. Existing zone choices, colours, effects, outputs and selection are preserved. Compact wall lines remain legible on narrow phones. The approved 3D tunnel/wall gallery examples and animation engines are unchanged. New-zone defaults also match native iPhone storage. The isolated demo uses fictional receivers only, no hardware commands, firmware downloads or PIN collection. Browser verification does not prove physical receiver acceptance.",
